# `index.js` and `index.d.ts` are generated by `napi build` and committed (see #832). napi always
# emits LF, so they must be stored and checked out as LF on every platform — otherwise a Windows
# checkout converts them to CRLF and the CI freshness check (`git diff --exit-code`) fails on every
# run against the LF files the Linux runner regenerates.
index.js text eol=lf
index.d.ts text eol=lf
